<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>AIMLAB · Experiment console</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"></head><body class="console">
<header><strong>AIMLAB <span class="muted">/ Console</span></strong><span id="connection" role="status">DISCONNECTED</span><button id="stop" class="danger">STOP ALL · Esc</button></header>
<main>
<section class="card connection-card"><div class="toolbar"><select id="output" hidden><option value="hardware">Hardware</option></select><label>Session<input id="participant" value="BENCH-001" maxlength="60"></label><label class="seed">Seed<input id="seed" type="number" value="1" min="0" max="4294967295"></label><button id="connect">Connect Uno</button><button id="disconnect">Disconnect</button><button id="testConnection">Check link</button><button id="audio">Test cues</button><button id="participantWindow">Participant ↗</button></div><span id="connectionDetail" class="muted">Connect Uno to start.</span></section>
<section class="card rig-card"><div class="sectionhead"><h2>Live rig</h2><span id="rigStatus" class="muted">Waiting for Uno</span></div><div class="rig-line"><div class="channel"><div class="actuator motor" id="rigMotor1"><div class="level-fill"></div><strong>M1 <small>D5</small></strong><output id="rigValue1">—</output><progress id="rigBar1" max="255" value="0" aria-label="Motor 1 reported PWM"></progress></div><label class="level-label" for="motor1">PWM <output id="motor1Value">83</output></label><input aria-label="Motor 1 PWM" id="motor1" type="range" min="0" max="255" value="83"><button data-condition="E">Test M1 · 5 s</button></div><div class="channel"><div class="actuator motor" id="rigMotor2"><div class="level-fill"></div><strong>M2 <small>D6</small></strong><output id="rigValue2">—</output><progress id="rigBar2" max="255" value="0" aria-label="Motor 2 reported PWM"></progress></div><label class="level-label" for="motor2">PWM <output id="motor2Value">83</output></label><input aria-label="Motor 2 PWM" id="motor2" type="range" min="0" max="255" value="83"><button data-condition="F">Test M2 · 5 s</button></div><div class="channel"><div class="actuator peltier" id="rigPeltier"><div class="level-fill"></div><strong>Peltier <small>D9</small></strong><output id="rigThermal">—</output><span id="rigPolarity">No status</span><progress id="rigThermalBar" max="255" value="0" aria-label="Peltier reported PWM"></progress></div><label class="level-label" for="thermal">PWM <output id="thermalValue">164</output></label><input aria-label="Peltier PWM" id="thermal" type="range" min="0" max="255" value="164"><select id="polarity" aria-label="Thermal polarity"><option value="H">HOT</option><option value="C">COLD</option></select></div><div class="channel"><div class="actuator motor" id="rigMotor3"><div class="level-fill"></div><strong>M3 <small>D3</small></strong><output id="rigValue3">—</output><progress id="rigBar3" max="255" value="0" aria-label="Motor 3 reported PWM"></progress></div><label class="level-label" for="motor3">PWM <output id="motor3Value">83</output></label><input aria-label="Motor 3 PWM" id="motor3" type="range" min="0" max="255" value="83"><button data-condition="G">Test M3 · 5 s</button></div><div class="channel"><div class="actuator motor" id="rigMotor4"><div class="level-fill"></div><strong>M4 <small>D11</small></strong><output id="rigValue4">—</output><progress id="rigBar4" max="255" value="0" aria-label="Motor 4 reported PWM"></progress></div><label class="level-label" for="motor4">PWM <output id="motor4Value">83</output></label><input aria-label="Motor 4 PWM" id="motor4" type="range" min="0" max="255" value="83"><button data-condition="H">Test M4 · 5 s</button></div></div>
<div class="master-row"><label for="master">All motors</label><input id="master" aria-label="Master motor PWM" type="range" min="0" max="255" value="83"><output id="masterValue">83</output><span id="settingsStatus" role="status">HOT 164 · motors 83</span></div><div class="lead-row"><label for="lead">Combined · Peltier lead</label><input id="lead" aria-label="Combined Peltier lead milliseconds" type="range" min="0" max="2000" step="10" value="0"><output id="leadValue">0 ms</output></div><div class="lead-row"><label for="motion">M1 → M4 duration</label><input id="motion" aria-label="Motion duration seconds" type="range" min="1" max="8" step="0.1" value="5"><output id="motionValue">5.0 s</output></div><div class="preset-row"><input id="presetName" aria-label="Preset name" placeholder="Preset name" maxlength="60"><button id="savePreset">Quick save</button><select id="presetList" aria-label="Saved presets"><option value="">Saved presets</option></select><button id="loadPreset">Load</button><span id="presetStatus" role="status"></span></div><div class="trial-row"><progress id="rigProgress" max="1" value="0" aria-label="Current trial elapsed progress"></progress><span id="rigTime">Idle</span></div></section>
<div class="columns"><section class="card operation-card"><div class="sectionhead"><h2>Experiment</h2><button data-open="details">Protocol / logs</button></div><div class="buttons"><button id="start" class="primary">Start · 160 trials</button><button id="continue">Continue · Space</button></div><p id="progress">No session running</p><progress id="bar" value="0" max="160" aria-label="Experiment progress"></progress><div class="sectionhead debug-heading"><h2>Individual mode</h2><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="cues"> Trial cues</label></div><div class="debug"><button data-condition="A">A · None</button><button data-condition="B">B · Thermal</button><button data-condition="C">C · Motors</button><button data-condition="D">D · Combined</button></div><p id="phase" role="status">Ready</p></section>
<section class="card preview-card"><div class="sectionhead"><h2>Participant preview</h2><span class="muted">Response: 1–5</span></div><div id="display" class="participant"><h2>Ready</h2><p>Remain still and watch the screen.</p></div></section></div>
<footer><span class="muted">Drive PWM · red HOT / blue COLD · no temperature feedback</span><div class="buttons"><button id="json">JSON</button><button id="csv">CSV</button><button id="recover">Recover saved</button></div></footer>
</main>
<dialog id="details"><div class="sectionhead"><h2>Protocol & session log</h2><button data-close="details">Close ✕</button></div><p>A: none · B: thermal · C: motors · D: combined</p><h3>Latin square</h3><table><tbody><tr><th>1</th><td>A</td><td>B</td><td>D</td><td>C</td></tr><tr><th>2</th><td>B</td><td>C</td><td>A</td><td>D</td></tr><tr><th>3</th><td>C</td><td>D</td><td>B</td><td>A</td></tr><tr><th>4</th><td>D</td><td>A</td><td>C</td><td>B</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Rows 1–4 twice per block. 5 × 32 trials; 60-second block breaks. Fixation varies by seed.</p><p>C/D duration T: SOA T/5; each motor runs 2T/5 with T/10 fades. Default T = 5 s. Combined thermal window is min(T, 5 s), shifted early by the lead. Timing and preset loading are locked during a session. Presets are stored in this browser; loading does not start outputs. B/D apply the selected thermal polarity. Sliders apply live and to subsequent trials; changing them does not start idle outputs.</p><p>Motor pins: M1 D5 · M2 D6 · M3 D3 · M4 D11. Peltier: ENA D9 · IN1 D8 · IN2 D7.</p><p class="muted">The display shows commanded PWM, not measured temperature. Session events are saved locally; JSON includes the full log and CSV includes trial responses.</p><pre id="events" aria-live="polite">No events yet.</pre></dialog>
<script type="module" src="app.mjs"></script></body></html>